---
layout: "../layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/>
<title>A2A Warden — Intermediario para agentes A2A</title>
<style is:global>
:root{--bg:#0b1120;--surface:#111827;--text:#e2e8f0;--muted:#94a3b8;--accent:#4f83f1;--accent2:#22c55e;--danger:#ef4444;--border:#1f2937;--radius:16px}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Noto Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,Helvetica Neue,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.55;margin:0;padding:0}
.container{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px 80px}
header{padding:90px 0 40px;text-align:center}
header h1{font-size:3rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.04em;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#a78bfa);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text}
header p.lead{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:640px;margin:0 auto}
section{margin:60px 0}
h2{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;border-left:4px solid var(--accent);padding-left:14px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px}
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;transition:transform .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(79,131,241,.12)}
.card h3{font-size:1.05rem;margin:0 0 8px;color:#fff}
.card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}
.tag{display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;background:rgba(79,131,241,.15);color:#93c5fd}
.tag.green{background:rgba(34,197,94,.15);color:#86efac}
.tag.red{background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:#fca5a5}
pre{background:#0f172a;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;overflow-x:auto;font-size:.88rem;color:#e2e8f0}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,"Liberation Mono",monospace}
.diagram{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#111827,#0b1120);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px;text-align:center;overflow-x:auto}
.diagram svg{max-width:100%;height:auto}
.diagram .label{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
input,button{font-family:inherit}
.interactive{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
button{border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 18px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;transition:filter .2s}
button:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}
button.secondary{background:var(--surface);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border)}
.menu{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;margin-top:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.menu a{padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;text-decoration:none;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#e2e8f0;border:1px solid var(--border);transition:background .2s}
.menu a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
footer{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);padding:40px 0;font-size:.85rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin-top:40px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<header>
  <h1>A2A Warden</h1>
  <p class="lead">Intermediario de confianza entre agentes A2A. Registra tráfico, verifica tarjetas firmadas, aplica políticas Cedar, y permite supervisión humana — todo en un executable.</p>
  <div class="menu">
    <a href="#caracteristicas">Características</a>
    <a href="#casos">Casos de uso</a>
    <a href="#config">Configuración</a>
    <a href="#inicio">Inicio rápido</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="caracteristicas">
  <h2>Características</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card"><h3>Reproducción y reenvío</h3><p>Mensajes con <code>message_id</code> corregido para replay/resend sin perder identidad.</p><span class="tag">A2A</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Tráfico en vivo</h3><p>Feed activo con UUID completo, JSON y formato de tiempo real; activa solo con click.</p><span class="tag green">Live</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Auditoría hash</h3><p>Cada transición registrada con cadena de hashes; paginación descendente (25/página), verificación de integridad.</p><span class="tag">Audit</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Tareas y aprobaciones</h3><p>Paginación servidor (<code>limit=25</code>, <code>offset</code>), filtros por estado, búsqueda con debounce ~300ms y texto preservado.</p><span class="tag">Admin</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Políticas Cedar</h3><p>Denegación por defecto; reglas por agente, skill, contenido o tenant; aprobación escalada manual.</p><span class="tag red">Policy</span></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Consola embebida</h3><p>Interfaz web integrada sin servidor Node externo; accesible en <code>/ui</code>.</p><span class="tag">UI</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="casos">
  <h2>Casos de uso interactivos</h2>

  <h3>Comunicación entre agentes (diagrama interactivo)</h3>
  <div class="diagram" role="img" aria-label="Diagrama de comunicación entre agentes">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 640 180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="max-width:640px">
      <rect x="20" y="60" width="100" height="60" rx="10" fill="#111827" stroke="#4f83f1" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="70" y="95" font-size="12" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">Agent A</text>
      <rect x="520" y="60" width="100" height="60" rx="10" fill="#111827" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="570" y="95" font-size="12" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">Agent B</text>
      <rect x="220" y="20" width="200" height="140" rx="12" fill="#0b1120" stroke="#1f2937" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="320" y="45" font-size="13" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">A2A Warden</text>
      <text x="320" y="65" font-size="10" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">Registra · Verifica · Aplica política</text>
      <path d="M120 90 Q170 90 220 90" fill="none" stroke="#4f83f1" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
      <path d="M420 90 Q470 90 520 90" fill="none" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
      <defs><marker id="arrow" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="10" refY="3" orient="auto"><polygon points="0 0, 10 3, 0 6" fill="#4f83f1"/></marker></defs>
      <rect x="320" y="110" width="140" height="36" rx="8" fill="#111827" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="390" y="134" font-size="11" fill="#fca5a5" text-anchor="middle">Aprobación manual</text>
    </svg>
    <div class="label">Agente A → Warden (registra y verifica tarjeta) → Agente B. Si hay política escalada, se requiere aprobación manual.</div>
  </div>

  <h3>Aprobación manual (diagrama interactivo)</h3>
  <div class="diagram" role="img" aria-label="Flujo de aprobación manual">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 640 160" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="max-width:640px">
      <rect x="20" y="20" width="100" height="40" rx="8" fill="#111827" stroke="#4f83f1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="70" y="46" font-size="11" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">Tarea creada</text>
      <rect x="160" y="20" width="100" height="40" rx="8" fill="#111827" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="210" y="46" font-size="11" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">Política escalada</text>
      <rect x="300" y="20" width="100" height="40" rx="8" fill="#111827" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="350" y="46" font-size="11" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">Pendiente aprobación</text>
      <rect x="440" y="20" width="100" height="40" rx="8" fill="#111827" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="490" y="46" font-size="11" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">Decisión humana</text>
      <rect x="580" y="20" width="60" height="40" rx="8" fill="#111827" stroke="#4f83f1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="610" y="46" font-size="10" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">Ejecutado</text>
      <path d="M120 40 L160 40" stroke="#4f83f1" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow2)"/>
      <path d="M260 40 L300 40" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow2)"/>
      <path d="M400 40 L440 40" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow2)"/>
      <path d="M540 40 L580 40" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow2)"/>
      <defs><marker id="arrow2" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="10" refY="3" orient="auto"><polygon points="0 0,10 3,0 6" fill="#4f83f1"/></marker></defs>
      <text x="320" y="110" font-size="10" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">Si se aprueba → se ejecuta. Si se rechaza → denegado y registrado en auditoría.</text>
    </svg>
    <div class="label">Tarea → política escalada → aprobación (pendiente) → decisión → ejecución. Todo auditado.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="interactive">
    <button onclick="document.getElementById('demo-modal').style.display='flex'">Ver demo interactiva</button>
    <button onclick="document.getElementById('demo-modal').style.display='none'" class="secondary">Ocultar</button>
  </div>
  <div id="demo-modal" style="display:none;background:rgba(11,17,32,.95);position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:50;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)">
    <div style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;max-width:560px;width:100%;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.4)">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Simulación: flujo con aprobación</h3>
      <p><strong>Agente A</strong> envía una tarea <code>create-order</code> a <strong>Agent B</strong>. La política Cedar requiere aprobación para ese skill.</p>
      <pre><code>policy:
  rules:
    - id: "esc-order"
      effect: escalate
      condition: "skill == 'create-order' && targetAgent == 'delivery-agent'"</code></pre>
      <p>Resultado: tarea en <span style="color:var(--danger)">pendiente aprobación</span>. El supervisor aprueba → se ejecuta y se registra en audit.</p>
      <button onclick="document.getElementById('demo-modal').style.display='none'">Cerrar</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="config">
  <h2>Ejemplos de configuración</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div>
      <h3>SQLite básico</h3>
      <pre><code>database:
  backend: sqlite
  sqlite:
    path: "./a2a-warden.db"
server:
  listen_addr: "0.0.0.0:8080"</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Agente con política</h3>
      <pre><code>agents:
  - name: "echo-agent"
    url: "http://127.0.0.1:9001"
    skills: ["echo"]
# Cedar: deny-by-default; allow echo skill only
policy:
  rules:
    - id: "allow-echo"
      effect: allow
      condition: "skill == 'echo'"</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>PostgreSQL + token guard</h3>
      <pre><code>database:
  backend: postgres
  postgres:
    host: localhost
    user: warden
    password: "&#36;{A2AWARDEN_DB_PASSWORD}"
admin:
  api_token: "&#36;{A2AWARDEN_ADMIN_TOKEN}"</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="inicio">
  <h3>Capturas</h3>
  <div style="display:grid;gap:16px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr))">
    <figure style="margin:0;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;text-align:center">
      <img src="/assets/tasks.png" alt="Tasks" style="max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)"/>
      <figcaption style="font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Lista de tareas con paginación y filtros</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure style="margin:0;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;text-align:center">
      <img src="/assets/task-details.png" alt="Task details" style="max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)"/>
      <figcaption style="font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Detalle de tarea y acciones</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure style="margin:0;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;text-align:center">
      <img src="/assets/task-completed-details.png" alt="Task completed details" style="max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)"/>
      <figcaption style="font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Tarea completada con auditoría</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <h2>Inicio rápido</h2>
  <pre><code>cargo build --release
./target/release/a2a-warden --config examples/config/sqlite.yaml</code></pre>
  <p>Consola: <a href="http://127.0.0.1:8080/ui" style="color:var(--accent)">http://127.0.0.1:8080/ui</a></p>
  <p>Ejecuta el agente remoto:</p>
  <pre><code>python3 examples/sample-agents/echo-python/echo_agent.py --port 9001</code></pre>
</section>

<footer>
  A2A Warden · Open source · <a href="https://github.com/the-cygnusdev/a2a-warden" style="color:var(--accent)">Repositorio</a> · Documentación en <code>docs/</code>
</footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
